      "text": "```\nAGE-SPECIFIC FERTILITY RATE (ASFR):\n  ASFR_x = (Births to women aged x) / (Women aged x) × 1000\n  Units: births per 1,000 women aged x per year"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-FERTILITY.md#005",
      "path": [
        "02-FERTILITY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:02-fertility, git-history:demography:02-fertility]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/02-FERTILITY.md",
        "concepts": "[fertility]",
        "current_path": "demography/02-FERTILITY.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:fertility",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fertility]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fertility",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TOTAL FERTILITY RATE (TFR):\n  TFR = Σ ASFR_x × n / 1000   (summed over all reproductive ages, n = interval width)\n  For 5-year age groups (15-19, 20-24, ..., 45-49):\n  TFR = 5 × Σ ASFR_i / 1000   (i = 7 age groups × 5 years)"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-FERTILITY.md#006",
      "path": [
        "02-FERTILITY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
