      "text": "GROSS REPRODUCTION RATE (GRR):\n  GRR = TFR × (proportion of births that are female)\n  ≈ TFR × 0.4878  (using sex ratio at birth of 1.05)\n  GRR = average daughters per woman (ignoring mortality)"
    },
    {
