        "title": "Fertility",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "NET REPRODUCTION RATE (NRR):\n  NRR = Σ ASFR_x × l(x) × (proportion female)\n  = average daughters per woman, accounting for mortality of women\n    before they reach each age x"
    },
    {
